<title>UK: OPEC basket price fell to $16.80 on Monday.</title>
<headline>OPEC basket price fell to $16.80 on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of OPEC's basket of seven crudes fell to $16.80 a barrel on Monday from $17.03 a barrel the previous day, the OPEC news agency said, quoting the OPEC Secretariat.</p>
<p>The basket comprises Algeria's Saharan Blend, Indonesia's Minas, Nigeria's Bonny Light, Saudi Arabia's Arabian Light, Dubai of the UAE, Venezuela's Tia Juana and Mexico's Isthmus.</p>
